History
Started as a perfume manufacturing facility on 2010. Initially to capture the growing perfume manufacturing market of UAE. So we created perfumes for brands in overseas and exported them, some distributed locally also to other retailers. In 2012 started creating brands by private labelling and also created own brand called Luxury Concept. Then went on to create Rifaat and Bon Milano after that. Rifaat is having arabic perfumery and Bon milano captures the french perfumery. In 2022 got certificated for ISO GMP cerificates and 2023 attended the beautyworld as a perfume manufacturer. In 2026 we registered trademark for Luxury Concept

